{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f35f80eb-8322-8f3b-8eb6-95ff918c21ca",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T10:29:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucia Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:27:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:27:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I've got an old refrigerator that a tenant left behind and I need to know how to get rid of it. Will the trash crew take it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appliances usually aren't part of the regular curbside pickup. Is it a fridge with a compressor, the kind that has Freon in it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:27:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's a regular full-size fridge. Probably twenty years old."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Those generally need a separate bulky item pickup, and the cooling system has to be handled properly. You'd schedule that with us rather than just setting it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:27:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a fee for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:27:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There can be a fee for large appliances, yes. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, so I'll have the solid waste office confirm it when they schedule you. Want me to take your information for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Lucia Medeiros. M-E-D-E-I-R-O-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And a number they can reach you at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:20-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-seven-eight. Perfect. And is the fridge at the curb already, or still inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still inside the unit. I wasn't going to drag it out until I knew what the deal was. With the storm Friday into Saturday, the sidewalks were a mess anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. Keep it inside until they set a date. Pickups have been a little backed up since that storm, so it might be a few days before you hear back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. My brother lives overseas, he owns part of the building with me, so he'll hear all about this call tonight. He'll want to know what it costs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Someone from that office will call you with the details, including the cost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:29:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:29:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Lucia. Take care."
    }
  ],
